{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/MapError"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gathers elements into arrays and emits each array when the strategy says to flush."}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","text":"AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch","text":"Batch","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","text":"BatchStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call."}]}],"name":"strategy"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)"},{"text":"), every interval","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)"},{"text":"), on a signal or a unit of work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy"},{"text":"), whenever any of several does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)"},{"text":"), or by a rule of your own (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"text":"). After every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence never emits an empty array.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pending ","type":"text"},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Throws","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/MapError\/batch(strategy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/maperror\/batch(strategy:)"]}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","beta":false},{"introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","beta":false}],"modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"title":"batch(strategy:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO8MapErrorV","fragments":[{